
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="description" content="Semantic Improvement of the College Page – HTML &amp; CSS course assignment">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Semantic Improvement of the College Page</title>
</head>

<body>

  <!--
  BEFORE (Assignment 13 using generic divs):
    <div class="top"> <div class="title">…</div> </div>
    <div class="menu"> … </div>
    <div class="content"> <div class="box"> … </div> </div>
    <div class="bottom"> … </div>

  AFTER (this file) – every div replaced by a tag that describes its purpose:
    div.top → <header>   div.menu → <nav>   div.content → <main>
    div.box → <section>/<article>   div.bottom → <footer>
    bold text → <strong>   dates → <time>   side info → <aside>

  Benefits: better accessibility, SEO and easier maintenance.
  -->

  <header>
    <h1>Invertis University</h1>

    <nav aria-label="Page sections">
      <a href="#college">College</a> |
      <a href="#course">Course</a> |
      <a href="#news">News</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>

    <article id="college">
      <h2>About the College</h2>

      <p>
        Founded in <time datetime="1998">1998</time>,
        Invertis University is known for its academic excellence
        and educational opportunities.
      </p>

      <figure>
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1067/500/260"
             width="500"
             height="260"
             alt="University campus building surrounded by trees">
        <figcaption>University Campus</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </article>

    <article id="course">
      <h2>BCA Artificial Intelligence</h2>

      <section>
        <h3>Duration</h3>
        <p>3 years (6 semesters)</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h3>Subjects</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Programming in Java</li>
          <li>HTML and CSS</li>
          <li>Computer Fundamentals</li>
          <li>Artificial Intelligence</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </article>

    <aside id="news">
      <h2>Latest News</h2>
      <p>
        Admissions and academic activities are conducted
        according to the university schedule.
      </p>
    </aside>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>
      &copy; 2026 Invertis University ·
      <a href="https://www.invertisuniversity.ac.in/"
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Official Website
      </a>
    </p>
  </footer>

</body>

</html>
